,"theme":"Unclassified","tier":""}],"thesis":"Shree Refrigerations is a ~30-year-old refrigeration/test-equipment maker that since 2016-17 became India's premier naval/defence HVAC & refrigeration supplier, claiming **~64% market share** in defence marine AC/REF/HVAC. It is the only Indian firm with \"3-of-3\" naval registrations — allowed to supply HVAC, AC/REF plant AND its own control panels — and the only firm that indigenized the full submarine (Scorpene) HVAC system. Core thesis = leveraged play on Indian naval fleet expansion (150 → 230 ships), merchant-marine shipbuilding push, and AON pipeline of ₹2.3-2.4 lakh cr (~₹2,500 cr addressable for AC/REF/HVAC at ~1% of project cost), with an optionality kicker in data-centre cooling via Smardt. Guidance: 40% revenue CAGR for 3-5 yrs; ₹1,000 cr revenue / ₹120-130 cr PAT by FY30-31.","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":null,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":null,"prev_zone_vpe":null,"r":null,"s":"SHREEREF","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"349.9","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"5.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"3.1","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"SHREEREF"}